    },
    {
        "text": "6:03 P.M. \\ Overcast \\ Visibility: 19 km",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "Desert by Lungmen \\ Facility #14",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_cher_3",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 1
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1#1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I've reached the destination.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "No other abnormalities found.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Report complete.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Frostleaf, why were you frowning the whole way here?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm just a little concerned about Amiya's group.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "They've already safely returned to Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Nearl and Dobermann already left Lungmen a week ago for their next assignment.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "It must be a pretty tough mission if it required sending those two together.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Blacksteel and Penguin Logistics both have their own matters to attend to.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Oh, Liskarm and Franka...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm... I'm glad that they're safe...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "You've got to work hard as well, just like them.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "When Franka sent you over to me, she spoke very highly of you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "R-really...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "If only you weren't so timid, she said.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#4",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Uuu....",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#4",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "...Hey, don't act like you're about to start crying!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Aren't you also a member of Blacksteel...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1#5",
        "name2": "char_219_meteo_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I, I'm not... crying...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "...In any case, let's continue our mission.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our next task is to work with the other recon teams to scout out this entire city.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Other than searching for survivors, we also need to assess the situation.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "If we encounter hostile Infected, we'll have to deal with the threat quickly.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "Even though our mission isn't particularly dangerous, it's still best to proceed with caution.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "text": "In the event that Reunion is involved in this, we'll retreat immediately and report back to Dr. Kal'tsit.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_259_Jessica_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Mmhm, mmhm!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Jessica"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_193_frostl_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Understood.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Frostleaf"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_219_meteo_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "All that's left for us to do... is to focus on our job.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Meteorite"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "playmusic",
        "intro": "$m_dia_street_intro",
        "key": "$m_dia_street_loop",
        "volume": 0.8,
        "crossfade": 1,
        "delay": 0.5
    },
    {
        "text": "6:12 P.M. \\ Overcast \\ Visibility: 19 km",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "Rhodes Island",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "text": "Deserted Nomadic City - 2 days after the discovery of 'Facility #14'",
        "tag": "name"
    },
    {
        "tag": "background",
        "screenadapt": "coverall",
        "image": "bg_bridge",
        "width": 1,
        "height": 1,
        "fadetime": 0
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 0,
        "fadetime": 1.5,
        "block": true
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.8
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Ah... You made it, Doctor.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Good timing, Dr. {@nickname}.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Our job here is about done. You probably won't see us for a while~",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "Are you leaving already?;...Got it.;I'll miss you.",
        "values": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2;3"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "We'll see you soon enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "It won't be long before we're back on standby in Rhodes Island.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't miss me too much.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Well, unfortunately, we don't have such an official-sounding reason. Right, Texas?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "Hold on a second...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Penguin Logistics... is about to go on vacation!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "It's only going to one precious day... But still--",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...Apologies. This isn't the best time to talk about it.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "delay",
        "time": 0.5
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "Don't worry... Everyone needs to get some rest.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "...I should be the one saying that to you.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "Huh...?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1#6",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "That's right, that's right. Amiya, girl, you really need a bit of R&R!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "There are many things in Rhodes Island that must be taken care of...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "I can understand that, but make sure not to give yourself too much pressure, Amiya.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_002_amiya_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter how strong your will is, your body won't be able to keep up if you get exhausted.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "You'd better not get sick. Everyone's counting on you!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "I... Everyone has always been looking after me.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_102_texas_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "We were also inspired by the way you fight.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Just that much is enough.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_103_angel_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Since I'm already here, I'll take this opportunity to get a free check-up before heading back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Our work here is about done anyway. Next up is...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, Dr. {@nickname}.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "focus": -1
    },
    {
        "tag": "decision",
        "options": "\u2014\u2014?;......",
        "values": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "predicate",
        "references": "1;2"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#7"
    },
    {
        "text": "I'm listening.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_106_franka_1",
        "name2": "char_103_angel_1",
        "focus": 0
    },
    {
        "text": "...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka & Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "text": "Keep up the good work~! Cheer up!",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Franka & Exusiai"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#6"
    },
    {
        "text": "Wha... huh?",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 1
    },
    {
        "text": "After we finish our report, we'll be right back.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Liskarm"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_107_liskam_1",
        "name2": "char_102_texas_1",
        "focus": 2
    },
    {
        "text": "No matter what, life must move forward.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "text": "Amiya, take care.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Texas"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1"
    },
    {
        "text": "Everyone... I...",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "character",
        "name": "char_002_amiya_1#2"
    },
    {
        "text": "...I will. You all take care as well.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "text": "See you next time.",
        "tag": "name",
        "value": "Amiya"
    },
    {
        "tag": "dialog"
    },
    {
        "tag": "blocker",
        "a": 1,
        "r": 0,
        "g": 0,
        "b": 0,
